    "title": "State Fair of Texas reveals 2026 Chevrolet Main Stage lineup - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Abbey Bowling ,\n4 hours ago DALLAS (KDAF) — The State Fair of Texas has announced the free Chevrolet Main Stage music lineup for the 2026 annual exposition. Fairgoers can experience live music at the Chevrolet Main Stage in Fair Park during all 24 days of the fair, with all performances included with their admission ticket. The 2026 State Fair of Texas runs from Friday, Sept. 25, through Sunday, Oct. 18. Read full article\n2",
